          "eyebrow": "Transmission - 003 / Colossal Biosciences",
          "title": "Bioacoustics",
          "copy": "Acoustic intelligence for wild landscapes isn't a future idea—it's already listening. I handled motion design, 3D modeling, and visual effects—translating that data into something you can actually follow on screen. Turning audio into visuals, shaping patterns into something readable, and guiding attention to the meaningful parts. There's a lot of detail work behind the scenes too—down to masking out individual snowflakes in one of the spectrograph shots, just to get it to sit right.",
